<title>HONG KONG: Gyongnam Merchant Bank sets $25 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Gyongnam Merchant Bank sets $25 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate certificate of deposit issue will be completed as a club deal, arranger KDB Asia said.</p>
<p>BORROWER GYONGNAM MERCHANT BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$25 MLN    COUPON    6ML+65 BP   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    11.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING  --	     REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    $250K</p>
<p> RATING   NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES   45 BP  ALL-IN RETURN  80 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER KDB ASIA</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
